<!DOCTYPE html><html lang="en"><head>
  <title>The Archive | Order of the Lion's Bell</title>
  <%- include("partials/metadata") %>
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/style.css">
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/archive-v2.css">
</head><body>
  <%- include("partials/header") %>
  <main class="archive-page">
    <section class="archive-hero">
      <p class="archive-kicker">THE PRESERVED MEMORY OF THE ORDER</p>
      <h1>THE ARCHIVE</h1>
      <p class="archive-intro">Research sources, public reports, preserved experience records and the published work of the Order of the Lion's Bell. Internal case work and correspondence remain sealed unless formally released.</p>
      <img class="archive-seal" src="/images/seal2.png" alt="Seal of the Order">
      <div class="archive-stats">
        <span><strong><%= overview.sources %></strong> RESEARCH SOURCES</span>
        <span><strong><%= overview.publishedReports %></strong> PUBLISHED BELL REPORTS</span>
        <span><strong><%= overview.publicExperiences %></strong> PUBLIC EXPERIENCE RECORDS</span>
        <span><strong><%= overview.openInvestigations %></strong> OPEN INVESTIGATIONS</span>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="archive-index">
      <a href="/bell" class="archive-entry"><span>I</span><div><h2>THE BELL ARCHIVE</h2><p>The recurring voice of the Order and its formal Bell Reports.</p></div></a>
      <a href="/archive/library" class="archive-entry"><span>II</span><div><h2>RESEARCH LIBRARY</h2><p>Books, papers, journals, government documents and archival sources preserved in HRL.</p></div></a>
      <a href="/archive/experiences" class="archive-entry"><span>III</span><div><h2>EXPERIENCE ARCHIVE</h2><p>Reviewed records of submitted anomalous experiences whose contributors consented to public preservation.</p></div></a>
      <a href="/archive/cases" class="archive-entry"><span>IV</span><div><h2>CASE ARCHIVE</h2><p>Public-facing index of the Order's case-file work. Internal working material remains sealed.</p></div></a>
      <a href="/report" class="archive-entry submit"><span>V</span><div><h2>SUBMIT AN EXPERIENCE</h2><p>Record an unusual event without presuming its explanation. Raw narrative is preserved separately from interpretation.</p></div></a>
    </section>

    <p class="archive-footnote">Record first. Interpret second. Test where possible. Preserve uncertainty where necessary.</p>
  </main>
</body></html>
